Calc: formulacell.cxx includes ScHint's header

0059 casts a hint to ScHint, declared in brdcst.hxx, which
formulacell.cxx never included. Windows builds found it through
the precompiled header; macOS clang without one stopped at the
incomplete type.

diff --git a/sc/source/core/data/formulacell.cxx b/sc/source/core/data/formulacell.cxx
--- a/sc/source/core/data/formulacell.cxx
+++ b/sc/source/core/data/formulacell.cxx
@@ -43,6 +43,7 @@
 #include <progress.hxx>
 #include <scmatrix.hxx>
 #include <docsh.hxx>
+#include <brdcst.hxx>
 #include <rechead.hxx>
 #include <scitems.hxx>
 #include <validat.hxx>
